        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Henri Larrivée, Pierre de La Garde, Daniel Auber, Giacomo Puccini\n- Works: the 1755 revived opera, Manon Lescaut\n\nFacts:\n- Henri Larrivée appeared in a revived opera in 1755.\n- Pierre de La Garde composed the 1755 revived opera that featured Henri Larrivée.\n- Manon Lescaut was composed by Giacomo Puccini.\n- Pierre de La Garde and Giacomo Puccini are different composers, so the 1755 revived opera and Manon Lescaut were not composed by the same person.",
